// AWS Lambda Function Code Updated  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1525, T1059.009
// Detects updates to Lambda function code (UpdateFunctionCode). Outside a deploy pipeline this can be a backdoor or supply-chain tamper.…
// False positives: Normal application/IaC deployments. Baseline against your CI/CD principals.
// Source: rules/persistence/lambda-update-function-code.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
(eventName in~ ("UpdateFunctionCode20150331", "UpdateFunctionCode20150331v2", "UpdateFunctionCode")) and eventSource =~ "lambda.amazonaws.com"
